# research/trials.ipynb is scratch work that prototyped the pipeline now living
# in src/. As JSON it is the second-largest file in the repo and takes nearly a
# third of GitHub's language statistics away from the code that actually runs.
research/*.ipynb linguist-documentation

# Never merge a notebook automatically. It is one JSON document on one line
# per cell, so git's line-based merge produces a file that is either invalid
# JSON or silently wrong -- duplicated cells, a half-merged outputs array.
# Resolve it by choosing a side.
*.ipynb -merge

# The book is the input data, not part of the project's source.
Data/** linguist-vendored

# Normalise line endings through the index; this repo is LF throughout.
* text=auto
